    "steam_appid": 1091870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN ADVENTURE LOST IN TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Theropods</strong> is a point and click adventure game that combines <strong>puzzles</strong> with a <strong>cinematic story</strong>, <strong>colourful characters</strong> and a <strong>retro aesthetic</strong>. Oh, and lots of <strong>dinosaurs</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/2da3f419cf1e29c4deb6603bc642e95e.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/2da3f419cf1e29c4deb6603bc642e95e.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/2da3f419cf1e29c4deb6603bc642e95e.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back to the time when dinosaurs ruled the world and (a little less further back) when adventure games ruled the gaming world! Immerse yourself in a vast, prehistoric world full of dinosaurs, constructed with love, <strong>PIXEL BY PIXEL</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HANDCRAFTED, PIXEL BY PIXEL</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/cd0a82b06bbfd4a7aae1cdc306bd8971.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/cd0a82b06bbfd4a7aae1cdc306bd8971.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/cd0a82b06bbfd4a7aae1cdc306bd8971.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive the <strong>golden age of adventure games</strong> with stunning, hand-drawn pixel art. Every character, dinosaur, and environment is brought to life with frame-by-frame animations, made with care and a lot of heart.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A THRILLING STORY WITH FASCINATING CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the journey of a fearless <strong>young hunter</strong> determined to rescue her enslaved tribe from a brutal band of barbarians. Meet a <strong>stranded spaceman</strong>, stuck on a strange prehistoric planet, desperately seeking a way home. <br><br>Together, they\u2019ll forge unlikely friendships, face betrayal and discover the courage it takes to survive in a world of <strong>danger and wonder</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/914d9134275a8649a94510ac106f9aec.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/914d9134275a8649a94510ac106f9aec.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/914d9134275a8649a94510ac106f9aec.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIVE INTO A TEXT-FREE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by games like <i>Machinarium</i> and <i>Gobliiins</i>, <strong>Theropods</strong> tells its story without traditional dialogue or text. <br><br>Through expressive <strong>grunts</strong>, nuanced <strong>animations</strong>, and clever visual <strong>storytelling</strong>, you\u2019ll be fully immersed in this prehistoric adventure.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/7923b7aba9c051887b4bc06177aa3eb7.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/7923b7aba9c051887b4bc06177aa3eb7.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/7923b7aba9c051887b4bc06177aa3eb7.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>No words, just pure gameplay and creative problem-solving!<br><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/922efc587592e78347b4d86ba1e9d6b3.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/922efc587592e78347b4d86ba1e9d6b3.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/922efc587592e78347b4d86ba1e9d6b3.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>A TOUCH OF SCI-FI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happens when cutting-edge tech collides with a land ruled by dinosaurs?\u00a0<br><br>From <strong>glowing energy pods</strong> to <strong>high-tech gadgets</strong>, the blend of sci-fi elements with prehistoric chaos creates a world unlike anything you\u2019ve seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/e28c8a8d81c6e7ae70141ac099b50eb6.poster.avif?t=1751978263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/e28c8a8d81c6e7ae70141ac099b50eb6.webm?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1091870/extras/e28c8a8d81c6e7ae70141ac099b50eb6.mp4?t=1751978263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
